{"3346790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ropebound", "steam_appid": 3346790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swing. Climb. Jump.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing through ropes and overcome obstacles. It’s all about timing and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/b39d87d88c35109d52e0481b6ceac881.poster.avif?t=1743438961\" width=528 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/b39d87d88c35109d52e0481b6ceac881.webm?t=1743438961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/b39d87d88c35109d52e0481b6ceac881.mp4?t=1743438961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple to move, hard to master.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are straightforward, but working with the ropes takes patience and practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/b1a4e945323c9699579891e447324e04.poster.avif?t=1743438961\" width=528 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/b1a4e945323c9699579891e447324e04.webm?t=1743438961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346790/extras/b1a4e945323c9699579891e447324e04.mp4?t=1743438961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\